abstract: >
  A metadata-rich, evidence-graded catalog of 31 significant data assets,
  institutions, visualizations, and technologies in the fictional
  constructed-language domain, serialized as JSON-LD with a DCAT v3,
  schema.org, and MLCommons Croissant crosswalk. Built with the BHIL VAULT
  framework.
